# Filled-in secret values, kept on the operator's machine only. This is the
# copy of what went into GitHub Actions -- those secrets are write-only and
# cannot be read back by anyone, including whoever set them, so without a
# local record a rebuilt server means reconstructing every credential from
# scratch. Never committed.
secrets.out/
